Explanation of the change:

- We remove the static `role="button"` on the `<label>`.  A `<label>` element is already a valid form-associated control, and introducing a role here was tripping the DAP check.
- We also remove the duplicate dynamic `role={role}` prop (it was pulled out of `this.props` but not actually needed once the default role is gone).  
- All other behavior (keyboard handling, `htmlFor`, styling, etc.) remains exactly the same.
